                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR ANZEIGE VON ÜBERTRAGUNGSZEITINTERVALLEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF PERMETTANT D'INDIQUER UN INTERVALLE DE TEMPS DE TRANSMISSION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND DEVICE FOR INDICATING TRANSMISSION INTERVAL</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a method and device for indicating a transmission interval, including that: a base station configures or agrees with a UE on interval information for sending uplink grant information, where the uplink grant information is used for performing uplink data retransmission; and the uplink grant information is sent at a position indicated by the interval information to schedule the UE to retransmit uplink data. The interval information is determined in one of the following manners: a first interval indicates an interval between a position of the uplink grant information used for performing the uplink data retransmission and a position of last data transmission of the UE; and a second interval indicates an interval between a position of the uplink grant information used for performing the uplink data retransmission and a position of uplink grant information corresponding to last transmission of the uplink data.</p>
            </abstract>
